WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.947
Brad: Why did the mites give Chuck and Dave to those ants?

2
00:00:05.948 --> 00:00:09.018
Danny: It looked like the ants paid for the bullies.

3
00:00:09.019 --> 00:00:12.013
Brad: So what are we going to do

4
00:00:12.014 --> 00:00:19.848
now? Danny: I guess we have to follow the

5
00:00:19.849 --> 00:00:22.118
ants. They’re coming back.

6
00:00:22.119 --> 00:00:24.422
Brad: Quick, hide!

7
00:00:24.423 --> 00:00:26.864
Danny: We have to find a way out of here.

8
00:00:26.865 --> 00:00:30.776
Brad: I think that’s going to be difficult.

9
00:00:30.777 --> 00:00:35.820
Danny: I’ll check if the coast is clear.

10
00:00:35.821 --> 00:00:38.144
Brad: Can you see anything?

11
00:00:38.145 --> 00:00:40.459
Danny: There’s something happening by the gate.

12
00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:43.834
Brad: What?

13
00:00:43.835 --> 00:00:46.307
Danny: What are they

14
00:00:46.308 --> 00:00:50.094
doing? Brad: They are opening the

15
00:00:50.095 --> 00:00:52.664
gate. Danny: I think someone is coming

16
00:00:52.665 --> 00:00:58.237
in. Brad: Maybe the ants are bringing the bullies

17
00:00:58.238 --> 00:01:01.520
back. Look, all the mites are gathering at the gate.

18
00:01:01.521 --> 00:01:07.685
Danny: They look excited about something.

19
00:01:07.686 --> 00:01:10.807
Brad: I can’t see any mites anywhere else.

20
00:01:10.808 --> 00:01:16.937
Maybe now is a good time to try to escape.

21
00:01:16.938 --> 00:01:19.243
Danny: No. Something is up.

22
00:01:19.244 --> 00:01:22.635
