23
00:01:22.636 --> 00:01:24.805
Brad: How do you know that?

24
00:01:24.806 --> 00:01:27.036
Danny: It’s just a feeling.

25
00:01:27.037 --> 00:01:33.764
Brad: My feeling is that we should make a run for it!

26
00:01:33.765 --> 00:01:36.710
They’re happy about something. Danny:

27
00:01:36.711 --> 00:01:43.665
What could possibly make a mite happy? Brad:

28
00:01:43.666 --> 00:01:46.047
Oh my gosh! Danny:

29
00:01:46.048 --> 00:01:49.930
I . . . I don’t understand! Brad:

30
00:01:49.931 --> 00:01:52.002
It’s Hopian!

31
00:01:52.003 --> 00:01:53.687
Danny: And Tina!

32
00:01:53.688 --> 00:01:56.413
Brad: How did Tina find Hopian?

33
00:01:56.414 --> 00:02:00.666
Danny: And how did they both get here?

34
00:02:00.667 --> 00:02:03.311
Bello: What are we going to do, Tina?

35
00:02:03.312 --> 00:02:05.267
Tina: I’m thinking, Bello.

36
00:02:05.268 --> 00:02:08.272
We have to escape somehow.

37
00:02:08.273 --> 00:02:11.155
Bello: But there are so many of them.

38
00:02:11.156 --> 00:02:15.849
Tina: My guess is that they aren’t as smart as us.

39
00:02:15.850 --> 00:02:19.956
This must be their fort.

40
00:02:19.957 --> 00:02:24.168
Bello: Those walls are very

41
00:02:24.169 --> 00:02:27.615
high. Tina: Wait! Look up

42
00:02:27.616 --> 00:02:29.472
there! Bello: That’s Brad and

43
00:02:29.473 --> 00:02:32.273
Danny! They look just like I

44
00:02:32.274 --> 00:02:34.149
remember. Tina: What are they doing

45
00:02:34.150 --> 00:02:37.373
here? I thought they shrunk the bullies, not themselves.

46
00:02:37.374 --> 00:02:42.578
Bello: It looks like they are prisoners too.

47
00:02:42.579 --> 00:02:44.929
Tina: I’ve got an idea.

48
00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:47.360
Look up there in the tower!

49
00:02:47.361 --> 00:02:51.008
I think they’re trying to escape!

50
00:02:51.009 --> 00:02:52.848
Danny: Why is she doing that?

51
00:02:52.849 --> 00:02:55.017
Brad: I don’t know, but look out!

52
00:02:55.018 --> 00:02:58.103
The mites are all coming this way.

53
00:02:58.104 --> 00:03:05.370
Danny: That Tina! She’s nothing but trouble!

